msg_id":"a5ed4a39-0c06-44ea-91b2-aec883fec25f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"gitはSIGPIPEで死ぬけど、生きてるとそれはそれで面倒ということですかね。。","ts":"1620727005.324700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c0HG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cda56f6-7e8b-4f2b-85d5-845ef4a36c12","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```$ tail -f /tmp/fzf-preview-files-from-resources | fzf | cat\n   %7B%22command%22%3A%22FzfPreviewFromResources%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22file%22%2C%22file%22%3A%22webpack.common.ts%22%7D webpack.common.ts\n[1]    55404 terminated  tail -f /tmp/fzf-preview-files-from-resources |\n       55405 done        fzf |\n       55406 done        cat```\nkillした結果","ts":"1620726976.324400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RSpa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ce89ef9-1341-4d03-af7a-71f2b887cfe0","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あーあれも類似パターン?","ts":"1620726974.324300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3PO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc837901-8b43-4ff0-840c-df4383ab7d8f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど","ts":"1620726965.323700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ts1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18dbb895-7b8c-49da-a37c-9b15af0d198e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"これなんかまえのgitの話もありましたね。\nあれはgitの後段のコマンドが終了するとgitがSIGPIPEで死ぬパターン。","ts":"1620726960.323500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P4L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11f14e93-16a7-4071-ace7-5ffd1e6c94da","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"それが得策そうだけど、どうやって実装するかたちなんだろうな","ts":"1620726954.323000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4jC+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c0ec34f-0ebe-4b55-a293-b29ec1287553","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"tailが終わったら期待通りの結果になるのかもしれない","ts":"1620726929.322200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JUgnv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67365c0f-f169-4752-9bb2-92cc36cd5baf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"パイプはプロセスが生きてれば繋がりっぱだろうから、なんかしらでtailかfzfが終了するようにしないとなんでしょうけど","ts":"1620726927.322000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gEN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21184a22-bab9-46cb-b3be-0ed1f712aa05","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"fzf が tail を殺すのはさすがに期待できないですよね","ts":"1620726922.321800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"brk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5521cbb-e392-4e90-bbdd-a949d6b6e6cf","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分そうですね","ts":"1620726912.321000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TOlSz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0b8aee2-5b6f-4a05-84bc-2b229c101a22","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"tail が終了しないと無理そう?","ts":"1620726905.320300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1P4qC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"237115ff-8b7c-4d84-bd70-52ad9f877eb1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"動いて欲しいんだけどなこれ・・・","ts":"1620726891.319900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Wq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30a8faee-8b6e-418c-bc8a-48185ed14dc7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"プロセス生き残っててfzfからcat完了後に制御戻ってこないんですよね","ts":"1620726872.319600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hG=rX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a78ae7e2-a8e5-4c7b-8a03-72bca3116d1e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あと、新しくプロンプトでてこないから